<title>NETHERLANDS: Endemol dips after half-year results.</title>
<headline>Endemol dips after half-year results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch television production group Endemol Entertainment slid 1.90 guilders, 3.11 percent, to 59.10 early on Tuesday after it posted a 19 percent jump in first half 1996/97 profits to 33.7 million guilders.</p>
<p>The results came in just below analysts' forecasts, which had ranged between 36 and 40 million guilders.</p>
<p>The company also reiterated its forecast that full-year earnings would rise between 15 and 20 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The results were a little disappointing although the forecast still looked positive,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
